<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission to produce new sugar estimates.</title>
<headline>EU Commission to produce new sugar estimates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised 1996-97 sugar crop estimates are due to be presented to the European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Final production figures are not yet available and the annual carry over stocks for 1997-98 have still to be finalised, the official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The European Commission will present a new balance sheet to the committee but the figures for production and carry over stocks are expected to be estimates,&quot; the official added.</p>
</text>
